imeline, and jump straight into the action. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >360\u00b0 Epic Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music-Driven Scoring </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable weapons</p></li></ul>",
